{"event": "token", "client_s": 19.741, "data": {"request_id": "a5d1c3aa48b7", "seq": 39, "ts": "2026-10-28T03:04:29.234Z", "t_ms": 19691, "delta": " Rule:** Under standard generation, if $\\mathcal{M}$ predicts `Retrieve == Yes`, the retriever fetches relevant passages ["}}
